>Anyone else go any ideas?
For a new type of monster.  Here goes:

Name : Giant Mutant Chicken
Found: Hunting in packs of 5-6, on one level only, possibly a mid-high 
       level.
Fighting: Hit points are collective - you can only hit one at a time, but 
          they all combine their hitpoints into one hit.
Incidence of dead chicken with any intrinsic - 1/10

If you killed a chicken and a corpse is left (with the intrinsic) then one 
of the following options would happen 

        A blessed corpse (# Dip in fountain or holy water)
        ----------------

Eat it.  The message given would be -
"You feel a change...<More>"
"You sprout wings....<More>"
"Cock-a-doodle-doo!"
You are then turned into a Giant Mutant Chicken for a short period of time.
If during this time you are attacked, then you may use the # Monster command
to summon fellow GMC's.
If you use the # Sit command you will produce a platinum egg.  If not picked
up after a certain number of moves then the egg will hatch to produce more
GMCs - and attack you on sight.  If the egg is eaten raw then the message
given would be -
"This egg tastes fowl...<more>"
"You feel sick..........<more>"
"You are blind."
You would stay blind 1-200 turns.

If however the egg is zapped first with wand of lightning or similar, or you
read the scroll of fire, or are zapped with fire, etc. then the message will
be -
"The platinum egg turns golden"
giving a "Cooked golden egg" in the inventory.  If eaten the message will 
be - 
"The spirit of Arthur Pilkington, Chartered Barbarian infuses your 
body.<more>"
"You decide to become an accountant"
The intrinsic developed will be automatic gold detection - once per level a
spell may be cast which will show all gold on that level. A suggested key
combination would be <Ctrl-G>.

        An uncursed corpse
        ------------------

Eat it.  The message will be - 
"Somewhere a cock crows...<More>"
"You feel an urge to jump up and down and flap you arms."
An intrinsic will be gained - the ability to polymorph into a GMC - but
not at will unless you have polymorph control. You will be unable to use
the # Sit and # Monster commands, however you will be able to use new 
commands # Fly and # Land - the amount of weight able to be carried will
be that of 10% less your normal ability.

        A cursed corpse
        ---------------

Eat it.  The following message will appear - 
"You feel sick...<More>"
"The Giant Mutant Chicken returns to life...<More>"
"The Giant Mutant Chicken calls her friends...<More>" - results in a flock 
                                                        of GMC's appearing.
"The Colonel Kentucky monster attacks."
Colonel Kentucky would have strength of a bugbear - eating him will
result in no intrinsic.

just an idea.

